#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "Where do the currency and metal rates come from?"
msgstr "Ba taux ya mbongo na ya bibende ewutaka wapi?"

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "Gold and silver prices are fetched daily from Swissquote's forex data feed. For each metal, the calculator takes the midpoint of every valid bid/ask quote and uses the median of those midpoints. Currency exchange rates come from FXRatesAPI. The displayed timestamp shows when the latest complete snapshot was successfully retrieved."
msgstr "Ba prix ya or na argent ezuami mokolo na mokolo na Swissquote's forex data feed. Mpo na ebende moko na moko, calculateur ezuaka point milieu ya devis nionso ya soumission/ask oyo ezali valide mpe esalelaka médiane ya ba points milieu wana. Ba taux ya change ya mbongo ewutaka na FXRatesAPI. Elembo ya ntango oyo elakisami elakisaka ntango oyo fɔtɔ́ ya sika ya mobimba ezwamaki malamu."

